{"user": "e did i go wrong?", "user_ts": "2026-08-05T17:12:31.523368+00:00", "assistant": "Hard to know the exact move without the history, but the final board shows the main problem:\n\n**White got 3 corners**: **a1, h1, a8**.  \nYou only got **h8**. Corners are permanent, and White used them to lock up the edges.\n\nFinal count looks like **White 44, Black 20**.\n\nSo the likely \u201cwhere it went wrong\u201d was earlier when a move **next to an empty corner** let White take that corner. Watch out especially for squares like **b1, a2, b2** near a1, or **g1, h2, g2** near h1, etc.\n\nEndgame lesson: don\u2019t ask \u201chow many do I flip now?\u201d Ask:  \n**\u201cDoes this give them a corner or lots of safe edge discs next?\u201d**", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-05T17:12:40.685966+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-05T17:12:44.089641+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"], "consensus": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"], "votes": {"Knowledge Deficit Question": 2, "Common Ground Question": 1}, "confidence": {"Knowledge Deficit Question": 0.6666666666666666, "Common Ground Question": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"llama": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"], "gpt": ["Common Ground Question"], "sonnet": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant": {"final": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint"], "consensus": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint"], "votes": {"Direct Instruction": 3, "Hint": 3, "Neutral Feedback": 1}, "confidence": {"Direct Instruction": 1.0, "Hint": 1.0, "Neutral Feedback": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint"], "llama": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint"], "sonnet": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Neutral Feedback"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "Gene